1
00:00:24,315 --> 00:00:27,485
So, this is the legendary headquarters
of the Birth Deity.

2
00:00:32,282 --> 00:00:34,241
Peng Ying, congratulations!

3
00:00:34,242 --> 00:00:36,452
From Heavenly Stork to Birth Deity's aide.

4
00:00:36,453 --> 00:00:38,245
Awesome! Starting tomorrow...

5
00:00:38,246 --> 00:00:39,621
no, today,

6
00:00:39,622 --> 00:00:41,708
no more working out in the sun and rain.

7
00:00:42,625 --> 00:00:44,418
You have to pass probation first.

8
00:00:44,419 --> 00:00:45,544
I...

9
00:00:45,545 --> 00:00:46,837
I should be fine, right?

10
00:00:46,838 --> 00:00:49,089
This is easier than being a stork.

11
00:00:49,090 --> 00:00:52,050
I have to make sure
babies are born safely.

12
00:00:52,051 --> 00:00:53,219
That was before.

13
00:00:53,803 --> 00:00:55,554
The Goddess wants

14
00:00:55,555 --> 00:00:59,266
us boosting birth rates with love potion
and red strings of fate.

15
00:00:59,267 --> 00:01:02,311
Wait, isn't that the Matchmaker God's job?

16
00:01:02,312 --> 00:01:04,397
The Matchmaker God has dementia.

17
00:01:08,068 --> 00:01:09,069
What's that noise?

18
00:01:10,653 --> 00:01:11,654
The Hell Department.

19
00:01:18,286 --> 00:01:19,287
What's this about?

20
00:01:20,205 --> 00:01:24,167
Too many deserving ghosts
want to reincarnate.

21
00:01:24,834 --> 00:01:28,963
The King of Hell says we're short on slots
and wants our department.

22
00:01:30,757 --> 00:01:32,216
Then we'd be out of a job?

23
00:01:32,217 --> 00:01:33,885
That's why we have KPIs.

24
00:01:40,350 --> 00:01:42,768
Ma'am, can you hear your baby crying?

25
00:01:42,769 --> 00:01:45,646
Babies cry. Is something wrong?

26
00:01:45,647 --> 00:01:48,982
You're on your phone. Baby's crying.
Be responsible.

27
00:01:48,983 --> 00:01:52,111
I've cared for him all day.
Can't I take a break?

28
00:01:52,112 --> 00:01:53,821
Have you ever had a baby?

29
00:01:53,822 --> 00:01:56,865
No. Having a kid means raising him too.
Be responsible.

30
00:01:56,866 --> 00:01:59,701
Know how hard motherhood is?
You hate kids. No empathy.

31
00:01:59,702 --> 00:02:01,745
Who are you to judge me?

32
00:02:01,746 --> 00:02:03,789
Don't ever marry or have kids.

33
00:02:03,790 --> 00:02:06,084
I'm not getting married or having kids!

34
00:02:57,218 --> 00:02:58,343
<i>Hi, beauties!</i>

35
00:02:58,344 --> 00:03:01,847
<i>Our boss brought these back from Korea,
totally trending.</i>

36
00:03:01,848 --> 00:03:04,975
<i>This T-shirt
has the hottest bottle neckline right now.</i>

37
00:03:04,976 --> 00:03:08,604
<i>It flatters your neck, hides neck lines,
and makes you look younger.</i>

38
00:03:08,605 --> 00:03:11,565
<i>This T-shirt was 1380,
but now it's only 999!</i>

39
00:03:11,566 --> 00:03:12,900
<i>It comes in five colors.</i>

40
00:03:12,901 --> 00:03:15,862
<i>Supplies are limited,
so grab yours now, beauties!</i>

41
00:03:19,616 --> 00:03:22,409
<i>Strawberry Candy, all colors again?</i>

42
00:03:22,410 --> 00:03:24,953
<i>Great taste! You really love me.</i>

43
00:03:24,954 --> 00:03:26,247
<i>You'll love these.</i>

44
00:03:29,375 --> 00:03:32,587
<i>Nana, if you don't like my clothes,
leave my livestream.</i>

45
00:03:34,505 --> 00:03:37,090
Meimei, next time Nana shows up,
block her.

46
00:03:37,091 --> 00:03:38,133
She's so annoying.

47
00:03:38,134 --> 00:03:39,843
Keep an eye on it.

48
00:03:39,844 --> 00:03:43,180
Ruyi, what if we
start losing followers like this?

49
00:03:43,181 --> 00:03:45,140
Bad customers are like hemorrhoids.

50
00:03:45,141 --> 00:03:48,144
Cut them off early.
Better now than suffer later, okay?

51
00:03:49,312 --> 00:03:52,189
- About that--
- Beer's on sale today.

52
00:03:52,190 --> 00:03:53,774
Remind me to buy some later.

53
00:03:53,775 --> 00:03:54,984
Ruyi.

54
00:03:55,944 --> 00:03:58,363
Ruyi, you really love to drink.

55
00:03:59,113 --> 00:04:02,407
With all this stress
and these nightmare customers,

56
00:04:02,408 --> 00:04:04,118
I deserve a drink.

57
00:04:19,717 --> 00:04:20,843
Meimei?

58
00:04:23,429 --> 00:04:25,306
Why is she resting while you work?

59
00:04:25,974 --> 00:04:28,017
Xiaolu's pregnant and sick.

60
00:04:28,810 --> 00:04:30,143
So what if she's pregnant?

61
00:04:30,144 --> 00:04:32,688
Every time we pack, something hurts.

62
00:04:32,689 --> 00:04:35,357
Now she's playing the pregnancy card.
Nice one.

63
00:04:35,358 --> 00:04:38,444
She requested maternity leave
a few days ago.

64
00:04:39,862 --> 00:04:42,281
If she's on leave,
won't you have to do it all?

65
00:04:42,282 --> 00:04:43,407
You'll be exhausted!

66
00:04:43,408 --> 00:04:45,075
Xiaolu has Mimi backing her up.

67
00:04:45,076 --> 00:04:46,285
I'll buy you a drink.

68
00:04:46,286 --> 00:04:47,370
Buy me a drink.

69
00:04:47,996 --> 00:04:49,621
Just one. Why four?

70
00:04:49,622 --> 00:04:51,790
You think I'm too skinny?

71
00:04:51,791 --> 00:04:53,166
Streaming that long?

72
00:04:53,167 --> 00:04:54,751
Mimi.

73
00:04:54,752 --> 00:04:56,628
Boss.

74
00:04:56,629 --> 00:04:58,213
This outfit is so pretty!

75
00:04:58,214 --> 00:05:00,007
You picked it, Boss.

76
00:05:00,008 --> 00:05:02,676
Everyone, I have an announcement.

77
00:05:02,677 --> 00:05:05,137
Mimi topped our sales again last week.

78
00:05:05,138 --> 00:05:07,097
Let's all learn from her, okay?

79
00:05:07,098 --> 00:05:10,143
Boss, stop. Keep it up. I'm blushing.

80
00:05:11,311 --> 00:05:12,353
Fuck!

81
00:05:13,104 --> 00:05:14,439
Don't run!

82
00:05:15,898 --> 00:05:17,316
I really didn't take it.

83
00:05:17,317 --> 00:05:20,194
It wasn't him.
Give back the five million you stole!

84
00:05:22,405 --> 00:05:23,363
- Sorry, miss.
- What?

85
00:05:23,364 --> 00:05:24,281
Mom! I'm sorry.

86
00:05:24,282 --> 00:05:25,491
Hurry...

87
00:05:27,160 --> 00:05:28,535
Sir, that's dangerous.

88
00:05:28,536 --> 00:05:29,662
Let go of me!

89
00:05:32,206 --> 00:05:33,374
I'm sorry. Sorry.

90
00:05:47,805 --> 00:05:48,973
Not the body.

91
00:05:59,942 --> 00:06:01,903
- No problem.
- I got it on video.

92
00:06:03,154 --> 00:06:04,489
Cops are coming.

93
00:06:09,285 --> 00:06:10,495
Tell your boss

94
00:06:11,245 --> 00:06:12,663
I didn't take it.

95
00:06:17,668 --> 00:06:19,545
- They're selling really well.
- Yeah.

96
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:23,006
Ruyi.

97
00:06:23,007 --> 00:06:24,841
Hi, Boss.

98
00:06:24,842 --> 00:06:28,512
You two doubled our sales this month.

99
00:06:28,513 --> 00:06:29,679
No big deal.

100
00:06:29,680 --> 00:06:33,767
Since we did so well,
can we ask for a small favor?

101
00:06:33,768 --> 00:06:35,102
Sure. Go ahead.

102
00:06:35,103 --> 00:06:36,812
Can all the streamers

103
00:06:36,813 --> 00:06:38,939
pick clothes together next time?

104
00:06:38,940 --> 00:06:40,524
That'd be fairer.

105
00:06:40,525 --> 00:06:41,818
Right, Mimi?

106
00:06:46,239 --> 00:06:48,156
Mimi. Mimi!

107
00:06:48,157 --> 00:06:52,703
Xiaolu, Meimei's busy streaming.
Can you sort the clothes later?

108
00:06:57,875 --> 00:06:59,710
I... got it.

109
00:07:00,253 --> 00:07:01,379
Thanks.

110
00:07:03,589 --> 00:07:04,756
Ruyi,

111
00:07:04,757 --> 00:07:06,591
you were bossing Xiaolu around?

112
00:07:06,592 --> 00:07:09,804
Of course.
She needs to know who's boss now.

113
00:07:10,430 --> 00:07:12,139
That was so cool!

114
00:07:12,140 --> 00:07:13,265
WEALTHY FAMILY

115
00:07:13,266 --> 00:07:14,350
Honey, careful!

116
00:07:17,562 --> 00:07:18,437
You wouldn't dare.

117
00:07:18,438 --> 00:07:20,188
You're fit.

118
00:07:20,189 --> 00:07:21,398
Let him take on ten.

119
00:07:21,399 --> 00:07:22,608
We'll watch.

120
00:07:31,492 --> 00:07:34,619
Zhuzhu, go inside with the guys.

121
00:07:34,620 --> 00:07:37,330
I've been holding it forever. I gotta pee.

122
00:07:37,331 --> 00:07:39,666
- Poor thing.
- I gotta pee!

123
00:07:39,667 --> 00:07:41,127
Go, go!

124
00:07:53,222 --> 00:07:54,514
Everyone, stay alert.

125
00:07:54,515 --> 00:07:57,642
Things aren't going well
with the Sanlong Gang.

126
00:07:57,643 --> 00:07:59,186
The Sanlong Gang...

127
00:07:59,187 --> 00:08:01,438
Their leader's leg and finger were broken.

128
00:08:01,439 --> 00:08:04,816
That kid saw me and bolted
like he'd seen a ghost.

129
00:08:04,817 --> 00:08:06,151
Almost took a bullet for him.

130
00:08:06,152 --> 00:08:07,527
Almost got shot...

131
00:08:07,528 --> 00:08:10,156
You're gangsters?

132
00:08:11,532 --> 00:08:13,201
- Us? Gangsters?
- Shush!

133
00:08:13,743 --> 00:08:16,203
- We do charity work.
- No, I do charity work.

134
00:08:16,204 --> 00:08:18,371
- We all do charity work.
- Yeah.

135
00:08:18,372 --> 00:08:20,624
Like him. He helps girls in need.

136
00:08:20,625 --> 00:08:21,791
Two last week.

137
00:08:21,792 --> 00:08:23,585
Me? I help bubbies cross.

138
00:08:23,586 --> 00:08:26,339
Pretty ones get a few extra trips.

139
00:08:27,423 --> 00:08:28,882
Do I look like a gangster?

140
00:08:28,883 --> 00:08:30,301
No, not at all.

141
00:08:31,636 --> 00:08:33,553
Just asking.

142
00:08:33,554 --> 00:08:36,890
If someone wanted
to leave the organization

143
00:08:36,891 --> 00:08:38,934
because of family reasons,

144
00:08:38,935 --> 00:08:40,769
how would that usually be handled?

145
00:08:40,770 --> 00:08:42,313
Just leave something behind.

146
00:08:43,856 --> 00:08:45,273
A signature will do.

147
00:08:45,274 --> 00:08:46,399
- A signature?
- Yeah.

148
00:08:46,400 --> 00:08:47,317
A resignation form.

149
00:08:47,318 --> 00:08:49,320
Organ donor form.

150
00:08:49,946 --> 00:08:51,781
So TV got it right?

151
00:08:52,573 --> 00:08:53,532
One kidney's enough.

152
00:08:53,533 --> 00:08:55,325
No, not me.

153
00:08:55,326 --> 00:08:56,409
I didn't.

154
00:08:56,410 --> 00:08:57,745
It wasn't me.

155
00:09:08,214 --> 00:09:10,465
- Bro Xiao!
- Damn it, I'm peeing! Don't sneak up.

156
00:09:10,466 --> 00:09:11,633
Didn't they teach you?

157
00:09:11,634 --> 00:09:12,969
Sorry.

158
00:09:13,761 --> 00:09:15,805
Bro Xiao, here's the thing.

159
00:09:16,389 --> 00:09:17,598
Tongban introduced me.

160
00:09:18,432 --> 00:09:20,184
I didn't know this was a gang.

161
00:09:20,851 --> 00:09:22,353
I've got nothing against you,

162
00:09:22,979 --> 00:09:25,355
but my late grandma hated gangsters.

163
00:09:25,356 --> 00:09:27,942
So... I still have to quit.

164
00:09:31,654 --> 00:09:34,323
Go tell whoever you work under.
Why tell me?

165
00:09:35,741 --> 00:09:38,743
Okay, okay. I'll find a replacement.

166
00:09:38,744 --> 00:09:41,329
You don't have to pay me
for the last two months.

167
00:09:41,330 --> 00:09:42,247
And...

168
00:09:42,248 --> 00:09:43,748
- Shush!
- Stop shushing me!

169
00:09:43,749 --> 00:09:45,084
I'm peeing, can't you--

170
00:09:59,807 --> 00:10:00,891
Bro Xiao!

171
00:10:03,394 --> 00:10:04,729
Bro Xiao, hurry up!

172
00:10:23,706 --> 00:10:24,582
Bro Xiao!

173
00:10:25,374 --> 00:10:27,251
Bro Xiao, what do we do?

174
00:10:35,176 --> 00:10:37,386
Why are you taking so long?

175
00:10:40,389 --> 00:10:41,974
Bro Xiao, hurry!

176
00:10:52,401 --> 00:10:54,487
Bro Xiao, are you okay?

177
00:10:55,488 --> 00:10:56,989
Your belt!

178
00:11:09,001 --> 00:11:11,212
Damn it, must've been A-Hu.

179
00:11:12,046 --> 00:11:13,339
I'll deal with him later.

180
00:11:14,632 --> 00:11:17,717
For you, for Little Rice Cake,
I'll be okay.

181
00:11:17,718 --> 00:11:21,554
We have Little Rice Cake now.
What if something happens to you?

182
00:11:21,555 --> 00:11:25,476
No way.
You haven't seen what my men can do.

183
00:11:29,522 --> 00:11:30,648
Hey, you out there!

184
00:11:31,565 --> 00:11:32,440
Hey, you!

185
00:11:32,441 --> 00:11:34,192
Yeah, you. Come in. Come in!

186
00:11:34,193 --> 00:11:36,444
Excuse me. Sorry. Sorry.

187
00:11:36,445 --> 00:11:38,113
Excuse me. Sorry.

188
00:11:38,114 --> 00:11:39,280
Who are you?

189
00:11:39,281 --> 00:11:40,740
Sir! My name's A-Li.

190
00:11:40,741 --> 00:11:42,450
Why don't I remember you?

191
00:11:42,451 --> 00:11:45,328
I work at the club.
Tongban's hurt. I'm filling in.

192
00:11:45,329 --> 00:11:48,082
- Thanks for helping me earlier.
- Doing my job, sir.

193
00:11:50,126 --> 00:11:51,751
You've got some moves.

194
00:11:51,752 --> 00:11:54,921
I majored in PE.
I used to train in judo and taekwondo.

195
00:11:54,922 --> 00:11:55,840
It's just...

196
00:11:58,509 --> 00:12:00,761
You're wasted at the nightclub,

197
00:12:03,597 --> 00:12:05,265
- A-Li.
- Yes, sir!

198
00:12:05,266 --> 00:12:08,852
From today,
you're the boss lady's bodyguard.

199
00:12:08,853 --> 00:12:09,979
Got it?

200
00:12:11,397 --> 00:12:12,440
But...

201
00:12:13,357 --> 00:12:16,401
- my grandma didn't like gangsters.
- You're not a gangster.

202
00:12:16,402 --> 00:12:18,070
- I'm...
- A bodyguard.

203
00:12:20,489 --> 00:12:22,240
You're her personal bodyguard.

204
00:12:22,241 --> 00:12:23,450
- Her...
- Bodyguard.

205
00:12:23,451 --> 00:12:25,368
- Bodyguard.
- Bodyguard.

206
00:12:25,369 --> 00:12:26,578
Not with the gang.

207
00:12:26,579 --> 00:12:28,330
- Not with the gang.
- Right.

208
00:12:29,039 --> 00:12:30,832
- It's on you.
- Got it.

209
00:12:30,833 --> 00:12:32,918
I'm a bodyguard...

210
00:12:33,919 --> 00:12:35,253
But my grandma...

211
00:12:35,254 --> 00:12:37,590
- I'll tell your grandma.
- Okay.

212
00:12:39,008 --> 00:12:43,429
But isn't a gangster's bodyguard
still a gangster?

213
00:12:54,190 --> 00:12:55,191
Ruyi.

214
00:12:57,735 --> 00:12:58,735
Do I know you?

215
00:12:58,736 --> 00:13:01,154
I knew you when we were kids.

216
00:13:01,155 --> 00:13:03,657
You should know me by now.
I'm Strawberry Candy.

217
00:13:04,492 --> 00:13:05,658
Strawberry Candy?

218
00:13:05,659 --> 00:13:08,786
You always nag me about
buying so many of the same outfit.

219
00:13:08,787 --> 00:13:10,330
You wanted to be my bestie,

220
00:13:10,331 --> 00:13:13,458
but maybe we should start as friends.

221
00:13:13,459 --> 00:13:14,877
You're Strawberry Candy?

222
00:13:15,503 --> 00:13:16,795
You're a guy!

223
00:13:17,463 --> 00:13:19,130
Why'd you buy so many clothes?

224
00:13:19,131 --> 00:13:20,840
I wanted to buy them from you.

225
00:13:20,841 --> 00:13:21,759
Wait.

226
00:13:22,635 --> 00:13:25,470
Are you here waiting for me?

227
00:13:25,471 --> 00:13:26,513
I'm an engineer.

228
00:13:26,514 --> 00:13:27,847
I used the dark web

229
00:13:27,848 --> 00:13:29,641
to find out you live nearby.

230
00:13:29,642 --> 00:13:32,143
You said we'd have dinner.
I wasn't waiting--

231
00:13:32,144 --> 00:13:33,353
My boss agreed,

232
00:13:33,354 --> 00:13:35,021
not me.

233
00:13:35,022 --> 00:13:36,022
Well...

234
00:13:36,023 --> 00:13:38,108
I have pepper spray! Stay back!

235
00:13:38,859 --> 00:13:41,236
No... You might need to...

236
00:13:41,237 --> 00:13:43,488
do something with the top part...

237
00:13:43,489 --> 00:13:44,489
Ruyi!

238
00:13:44,490 --> 00:13:46,158
Ruyi, it burns! It burns!

239
00:13:52,831 --> 00:13:56,085
I just wanted to be friends with you.

240
00:14:06,679 --> 00:14:07,555
Thank you.

241
00:14:09,181 --> 00:14:10,431
- What?
- Her!

242
00:14:10,432 --> 00:14:11,349
Who?

243
00:14:11,350 --> 00:14:12,600
That bitch behind you.

244
00:14:12,601 --> 00:14:14,435
Which bit...

245
00:14:14,436 --> 00:14:16,187
She's pretty hot.

246
00:14:16,188 --> 00:14:19,733
Hot? Please. Help me deal with her.

247
00:14:22,444 --> 00:14:23,487
Hold this.

248
00:14:24,989 --> 00:14:26,073
Hold it lower.

249
00:14:27,157 --> 00:14:28,284
Come on!

250
00:14:38,043 --> 00:14:40,003
Leave it to me. I'll handle it.

251
00:14:40,004 --> 00:14:41,714
Badass!

252
00:14:47,219 --> 00:14:48,721
First time here?

253
00:14:49,555 --> 00:14:50,723
Hey?

254
00:14:52,141 --> 00:14:53,558
Is this your first time?

255
00:14:53,559 --> 00:14:54,517
My eighth time.

256
00:14:54,518 --> 00:14:56,185
Eighth time? Regular now.

257
00:14:56,186 --> 00:14:59,522
My friend and I own this place.
This drink's on me.

258
00:14:59,523 --> 00:15:00,732
I got one, thanks.

259
00:15:00,733 --> 00:15:03,360
Then have some water.

260
00:15:03,944 --> 00:15:05,446
I'm good. I have a drink.

261
00:15:06,030 --> 00:15:07,281
Why so cold?

262
00:15:08,032 --> 00:15:09,033
What's your name?

263
00:15:11,619 --> 00:15:15,079
Honestly, I don't want
to talk to strangers today.

264
00:15:15,080 --> 00:15:16,790
I just had a bad experience.

265
00:15:17,291 --> 00:15:20,336
If you keep bothering me, I'll record you.

266
00:15:22,796 --> 00:15:24,006
No need for that.

267
00:15:24,590 --> 00:15:26,592
Have a nice evening. I'm leaving.

268
00:15:31,430 --> 00:15:32,389
Shit!

269
00:15:34,266 --> 00:15:35,475
Tongban!

270
00:15:35,476 --> 00:15:37,353
- Sorry. I'm sorry.
- A-Li, hold this.

271
00:15:37,937 --> 00:15:39,520
Tongban told you, right?

272
00:15:39,521 --> 00:15:40,981
- Don't do it again.
- Don't.

273
00:15:41,857 --> 00:15:43,358
Tongban, are you okay?

274
00:15:43,359 --> 00:15:44,442
What do you think?

275
00:15:44,443 --> 00:15:45,401
Tongban, sorry.

276
00:15:45,402 --> 00:15:49,030
Been taking hits lately,
so I put a tray in there.

277
00:15:49,031 --> 00:15:50,198
Cheap and effective.

278
00:15:50,199 --> 00:15:51,492
Are you fucking crazy?

279
00:15:52,076 --> 00:15:54,327
No, it's just
someone's been using my name.

280
00:15:54,328 --> 00:15:56,288
Tongban, can you find out who it is?

281
00:15:58,290 --> 00:16:00,291
Think I'm a pushover?

282
00:16:00,292 --> 00:16:01,835
Hand over the money!

283
00:16:02,628 --> 00:16:03,711
Tongban!

284
00:16:03,712 --> 00:16:04,671
It wasn't me.

285
00:16:04,672 --> 00:16:06,297
Definitely not me. No way.

286
00:16:06,298 --> 00:16:07,757
Tongban wouldn't, right?

287
00:16:07,758 --> 00:16:10,635
- Why look guilty?
- Me? Guilty? I'm not guilty.

288
00:16:10,636 --> 00:16:13,429
A-Li, I love how innocent you are.

289
00:16:13,430 --> 00:16:15,139
- Tongban will help you.
- Tongban...

290
00:16:15,140 --> 00:16:17,809
There's a really big guy looking for you.

291
00:16:17,810 --> 00:16:19,978
It's fine. I slept with his girlfriend.

292
00:16:19,979 --> 00:16:21,479
You're terrible!

293
00:16:21,480 --> 00:16:22,438
You'll get it.

294
00:16:22,439 --> 00:16:24,400
- I can't drink.
- It's water.

295
00:16:27,152 --> 00:16:28,569
Seen Tongban?

296
00:16:28,570 --> 00:16:29,613
Over there.

297
00:16:30,906 --> 00:16:32,074
Tongban's here.

298
00:16:45,671 --> 00:16:48,881
The assistant handling Taiwan's birth rate
quit due to depression.

299
00:16:48,882 --> 00:16:50,508
That's how you got this position.

300
00:16:50,509 --> 00:16:51,676
How did I not know?

301
00:16:51,677 --> 00:16:52,927
Pretty rare.

302
00:16:52,928 --> 00:16:55,346
One day in heaven is a year on Earth.

303
00:16:55,347 --> 00:16:58,975
So you need to get 140,000 babies
born in one day to pass probation.

304
00:16:58,976 --> 00:17:00,685
140,000? In one day?

305
00:17:00,686 --> 00:17:02,146
- Is that possible?
- Yes.

306
00:17:03,605 --> 00:17:04,982
- That's nuts!
- Good luck.

307
00:17:05,607 --> 00:17:06,567
Let's start.

308
00:17:16,952 --> 00:17:18,704
Careful! Careful!

309
00:17:22,416 --> 00:17:24,334
Ready, go!

310
00:17:25,127 --> 00:17:25,961
<i>Pregnant?</i>

311
00:17:26,545 --> 00:17:27,587
How's that possible?

312
00:17:27,588 --> 00:17:30,882
Doctor, I have fibroids
and very irregular periods.

313
00:17:30,883 --> 00:17:33,342
I can't conceive. How am I pregnant?

314
00:17:33,343 --> 00:17:34,720
You really are pregnant.

315
00:17:35,471 --> 00:17:38,474
The ultrasound shows
you're over two months pregnant.

316
00:17:39,391 --> 00:17:42,727
Can you prescribe me abortion pills?

317
00:17:42,728 --> 00:17:46,273
Miss, why don't you go home
and discuss it with your family?

318
00:18:15,427 --> 00:18:16,595
No way.

319
00:18:25,062 --> 00:18:26,105
I'm screwed.

320
00:18:27,147 --> 00:18:28,524
I got drunk and messed up.

321
00:18:57,136 --> 00:18:59,388
Taozi, don't be scared. I'll protect you.

322
00:18:59,888 --> 00:19:01,390
Cover your ears.

323
00:19:17,447 --> 00:19:19,283
Keep your little sister safe.

324
00:19:28,542 --> 00:19:29,835
Mom!

325
00:19:40,512 --> 00:19:41,638
Mom!

326
00:20:12,336 --> 00:20:13,836
Sweetie, wake up.

327
00:20:13,837 --> 00:20:17,298
Have breakfast,
then we'll take your fever medicine.

328
00:20:17,299 --> 00:20:19,551
Taozi, wake up.

329
00:20:21,762 --> 00:20:23,804
Come on.

330
00:20:23,805 --> 00:20:25,514
Don't sleep anymore.

331
00:20:25,515 --> 00:20:27,183
Taozi.

332
00:20:27,184 --> 00:20:28,936
Please wake up!

333
00:20:29,853 --> 00:20:30,687
Taozi!

334
00:21:11,645 --> 00:21:13,145
<i>Why get an abortion?</i>

335
00:21:13,146 --> 00:21:14,897
Why not keep the baby?

336
00:21:14,898 --> 00:21:16,691
TAIWAN - RUYI

337
00:21:16,692 --> 00:21:18,068
Don't go.

338
00:21:21,321 --> 00:21:22,239
What are you doing?

339
00:21:23,323 --> 00:21:24,240
Where you going?

340
00:21:24,241 --> 00:21:26,367
Wait, this isn't the way home.

341
00:21:26,368 --> 00:21:28,412
Your place is the other way, you know?

342
00:21:30,872 --> 00:21:31,707
SERVICE ENDED

343
00:21:38,839 --> 00:21:42,925
<i>At three months,
the fetus's eyes, ears, nose, mouth</i>

344
00:21:42,926 --> 00:21:45,386
<i>and limbs have developed.</i>

345
00:21:45,387 --> 00:21:47,556
<i>It already looks like a tiny person.</i>

346
00:21:48,557 --> 00:21:49,766
I'll get it done.

347
00:21:52,352 --> 00:21:54,312
Why am I so busy?

348
00:21:54,313 --> 00:21:56,564
Look, I gotta go.

349
00:21:56,565 --> 00:21:59,191
Think it over.
Don't rush into an abortion.

350
00:21:59,192 --> 00:22:01,111
Seriously. I'll be back.

351
00:22:08,702 --> 00:22:09,578
Thank you.

352
00:22:13,999 --> 00:22:15,042
Thanks.

353
00:22:18,879 --> 00:22:20,005
Your first baby?

354
00:22:22,716 --> 00:22:24,551
This is my first, too.

355
00:22:28,889 --> 00:22:31,641
I finished my checkup,
and I'm waiting for my husband.

356
00:22:34,394 --> 00:22:36,271
Did you come alone?

357
00:22:38,774 --> 00:22:40,566
I don't let my husband come with me

358
00:22:40,567 --> 00:22:43,445
because he gets
even more nervous than I do.

359
00:22:45,572 --> 00:22:48,033
Our daughter was conceived through IVF.

360
00:22:49,326 --> 00:22:51,703
It took four or five years...

361
00:22:52,954 --> 00:22:55,165
and was really tough.

362
00:22:56,875 --> 00:23:00,336
I even prayed to the
Goddess of Childbirth,

363
00:23:00,337 --> 00:23:01,755
but nothing worked.

364
00:23:03,173 --> 00:23:06,927
In the end, my husband and I
decided to use a sperm bank for IVF.

365
00:23:07,677 --> 00:23:10,846
I don't know who the donor is,
but who cares?

366
00:23:10,847 --> 00:23:13,934
I'm the baby's mom.
That's what matters, right?

367
00:23:16,186 --> 00:23:19,189
I'm going to give my child so much love.

368
00:23:22,442 --> 00:23:23,693
Don't you think

369
00:23:24,653 --> 00:23:28,740
children are destined
to end up with certain parents?

370
00:23:31,118 --> 00:23:32,202
<i>I want an abortion.</i>

371
00:23:33,203 --> 00:23:34,411
Are you sure?

372
00:23:34,412 --> 00:23:37,081
The baby's eight weeks and looks healthy.

373
00:23:37,082 --> 00:23:39,543
Your due date is April 1st.

374
00:23:45,215 --> 00:23:46,633
April 1st?

375
00:24:10,699 --> 00:24:12,200
Sis...

376
00:24:13,952 --> 00:24:15,620
Sorry. Sorry.

377
00:24:16,204 --> 00:24:17,663
I'm sorry.

378
00:24:17,664 --> 00:24:18,999
Don't hug me.

379
00:24:20,250 --> 00:24:22,626
- Mom, I want some douhua.
- Sure.

380
00:24:22,627 --> 00:24:25,005
- Let's go get some later, okay?
- Okay.

381
00:24:30,218 --> 00:24:31,051
Yummy?

382
00:24:31,052 --> 00:24:32,137
Yummy!

383
00:24:34,723 --> 00:24:35,724
Excuse me.

384
00:24:36,474 --> 00:24:37,766
One bowl of douhua, please.

385
00:24:37,767 --> 00:24:40,102
Sorry, we're closing early.

386
00:24:40,103 --> 00:24:41,770
The last bowl's already taken.

387
00:24:41,771 --> 00:24:42,981
There's none left?

388
00:24:44,316 --> 00:24:46,109
Yeah. Come back tomorrow.

389
00:24:50,363 --> 00:24:52,490
But I want some now.

390
00:24:54,993 --> 00:24:57,077
Ma'am, my douhua, please.

391
00:24:57,078 --> 00:24:57,996
Here you go.

392
00:24:58,914 --> 00:25:00,289
Your douhua.

393
00:25:00,290 --> 00:25:01,374
Thank you.

394
00:25:02,918 --> 00:25:03,834
What's wrong?

395
00:25:03,835 --> 00:25:07,129
I said we're out, and she started crying.

396
00:25:07,130 --> 00:25:08,548
I don't know what to do.

397
00:25:14,888 --> 00:25:16,681
Hey, Zhuzhu.

398
00:25:17,182 --> 00:25:19,391
Yeah, I got everything you wanted.

399
00:25:19,392 --> 00:25:21,518
I'm heading back now.

400
00:25:21,519 --> 00:25:22,979
Maybe another...

401
00:25:23,480 --> 00:25:26,023
ten minutes. Douhua just got sold out,

402
00:25:26,024 --> 00:25:29,861
so I need to find another place
that has some.

403
00:25:30,779 --> 00:25:33,198
Yeah. <i>Okay.</i> See you soon. <i>Bye-bye.</i>

404
00:25:34,824 --> 00:25:35,659
You're welcome.

405
00:25:36,785 --> 00:25:37,827
Thank you.

406
00:25:59,641 --> 00:26:02,602
I used to call you Taozi, remember?

407
00:26:07,732 --> 00:26:08,984
Taozi.

408
00:26:14,489 --> 00:26:16,740
<i>I guess we really were meant
to be together.</i>

409
00:26:16,741 --> 00:26:20,203
<i>Little sis, you've come back
to be with me in this life.</i>

410
00:26:29,754 --> 00:26:31,631
Since you've decided to stay,

411
00:26:33,633 --> 00:26:35,218
be a good girl, okay?

412
00:26:40,598 --> 00:26:43,100
I told the boss
I'm taking a few months off.

413
00:26:43,101 --> 00:26:44,810
I'll be back after the birth.

414
00:26:44,811 --> 00:26:48,022
You've worked with many streamers.
You'll do great.

415
00:26:48,023 --> 00:26:50,024
Gotta go. Bye.

416
00:26:50,025 --> 00:26:51,151
You sure?

417
00:26:51,735 --> 00:26:53,902
Miss, are these dried anchovies fresh?

418
00:26:53,903 --> 00:26:56,197
Of course. Made yesterday. Check the date.

419
00:26:56,865 --> 00:26:58,657
Ruyi, it's really busy.

420
00:26:58,658 --> 00:27:00,285
Can you come help in a bit?

421
00:27:01,661 --> 00:27:03,288
I just came in.

422
00:27:34,402 --> 00:27:35,403
I'm beat.

423
00:27:38,198 --> 00:27:39,198
Why are you here?

424
00:27:39,199 --> 00:27:41,326
- Ruyi, long time no see.
- How'd you find my place?

425
00:27:42,327 --> 00:27:43,952
I asked the guard downstairs.

426
00:27:43,953 --> 00:27:46,121
Why'd the guard tell you where I live?

427
00:27:46,122 --> 00:27:48,248
Are you nuts? What do you want?

428
00:27:48,249 --> 00:27:50,250
I came to buy some clothes.

429
00:27:50,251 --> 00:27:51,877
But you stopped streaming.

430
00:27:51,878 --> 00:27:54,922
There are tons of other streamers.
Why buy from me?

431
00:27:54,923 --> 00:27:56,882
We went to the same school.

432
00:27:56,883 --> 00:27:58,967
You were in the upper grades
when I was younger.

433
00:27:58,968 --> 00:28:02,846
I grew up in an orphanage,
so everyone called me A-Gu back then.

434
00:28:02,847 --> 00:28:04,264
Remember me?

435
00:28:04,265 --> 00:28:06,558
That was so long ago. Who'd remember?

436
00:28:06,559 --> 00:28:09,854
King oyster mushroom? Cluck-cluck chicken?

437
00:28:10,438 --> 00:28:13,650
Once, when I got bullied,
you even stood up for me.

438
00:28:14,651 --> 00:28:17,444
Is that why you kept
buying clothes from me?

439
00:28:17,445 --> 00:28:19,988
I was really grateful to you.

440
00:28:19,989 --> 00:28:22,574
I gave away all the clothes
I bought from you.

441
00:28:22,575 --> 00:28:23,868
You're nuts.

442
00:28:24,786 --> 00:28:26,495
I brought you some stinky tofu.

443
00:28:26,496 --> 00:28:30,416
You said on your stream that you liked it.
It's famous. Super crispy.

444
00:28:30,417 --> 00:28:32,794
Take it away. It stinks! It smells awful!

445
00:28:33,711 --> 00:28:35,046
Do you have a stomach bug?

446
00:28:35,672 --> 00:28:36,588
Nope.

447
00:28:36,589 --> 00:28:39,174
You don't look too well.

448
00:28:39,175 --> 00:28:40,759
Need a doctor?

449
00:28:40,760 --> 00:28:41,885
Already went.

450
00:28:41,886 --> 00:28:43,637
So what did the doctor say?

451
00:28:43,638 --> 00:28:45,347
He said I'm pregnant.

452
00:28:45,348 --> 00:28:47,057
Not gaining weight. I'm pregnant.

453
00:28:47,058 --> 00:28:48,143
Pregnant?

454
00:28:49,144 --> 00:28:51,353
- You have a boyfriend.
- I don't!

455
00:28:51,354 --> 00:28:53,064
My baby. None of your business!

456
00:28:53,773 --> 00:28:54,857
Go! That tofu reeks.

457
00:28:54,858 --> 00:28:56,650
Get it away!

458
00:28:56,651 --> 00:28:57,736
I hate it!

459
00:29:08,913 --> 00:29:10,914
I got you some lighter food.

460
00:29:10,915 --> 00:29:12,833
Hope it won't make you nauseous.

461
00:29:12,834 --> 00:29:15,043
I got you some vitamins and supplements.

462
00:29:15,044 --> 00:29:17,881
They say pregnant women
need more folic acid.

463
00:29:18,840 --> 00:29:20,550
Are you stupid or what?

464
00:29:21,134 --> 00:29:23,469
What part didn't you understand?

465
00:29:23,470 --> 00:29:25,429
Will your boyfriend take responsibility?

466
00:29:25,430 --> 00:29:28,433
- No boyfriend. This baby's mine.
- Then let me help you.

467
00:29:32,187 --> 00:29:33,312
Why would you help me?

468
00:29:33,313 --> 00:29:34,855
I don't even know you.

469
00:29:34,856 --> 00:29:37,065
Raising a baby alone is hard.

470
00:29:37,066 --> 00:29:41,361
You'll need help.
I have money, stocks and company bonuses.

471
00:29:41,362 --> 00:29:42,280
When the money...

472
00:29:43,239 --> 00:29:45,991
When the baby's born,
I can help you raise it.

473
00:29:45,992 --> 00:29:49,287
Don't send the baby to an orphanage
to be bullied.

474
00:29:52,207 --> 00:29:53,833
Who said I'll do that?

475
00:29:56,252 --> 00:29:57,962
You're won't? That's great.

476
00:29:58,838 --> 00:30:00,381
Here, take all this.

477
00:30:11,643 --> 00:30:12,936
Is he crazy?

478
00:30:13,937 --> 00:30:15,313
Should I call the police?

479
00:30:16,606 --> 00:30:17,816
But he's already gone.

480
00:30:21,319 --> 00:30:22,986
This is turtle-and-deer chicken essence.

481
00:30:22,987 --> 00:30:24,613
And I got you a pregnancy pillow

482
00:30:24,614 --> 00:30:25,865
for your back.

483
00:30:32,205 --> 00:30:33,206
That's a lot.

484
00:30:34,916 --> 00:30:37,835
Ruyi, take these.
I got them at the morning market.

485
00:30:37,836 --> 00:30:40,254
There's radish and some leafy greens.

486
00:30:40,255 --> 00:30:42,423
Eat more veggies to prevent constipation.

487
00:30:44,425 --> 00:30:45,301
Wanna come in

488
00:30:46,135 --> 00:30:47,178
and get cleaned up?

489
00:30:47,762 --> 00:30:48,804
It's okay.

490
00:30:48,805 --> 00:30:51,598
- No, it's okay. I'm afraid I'll...
- Come on, hurry up.

491
00:30:51,599 --> 00:30:53,308
You'll get the hallway wet.

492
00:30:53,309 --> 00:30:54,644
Quit fussing.

493
00:30:58,147 --> 00:30:59,690
- Dry yourself off.
- Sorry.

494
00:30:59,691 --> 00:31:01,776
- Sorry I got it wet...
- It's fine. Dry off.

495
00:31:03,444 --> 00:31:05,737
It's okay. I can do it myself.
I've got it.

496
00:31:05,738 --> 00:31:07,239
Thank you. Thanks.

497
00:31:07,240 --> 00:31:08,740
- I'll leave it here.
- Okay.

498
00:31:08,741 --> 00:31:10,493
- It's hot.
- I'm fine.

499
00:31:15,373 --> 00:31:16,790
- Thanks.
- Careful, it's hot.

500
00:31:16,791 --> 00:31:18,835
- Dry off quickly. Don't catch a cold.
- Okay.

501
00:31:21,629 --> 00:31:22,589
Look.

502
00:31:23,172 --> 00:31:25,132
It's so tiny. That's the head.

503
00:31:25,133 --> 00:31:27,051
It looks like a swim cap.

504
00:31:27,719 --> 00:31:29,219
"Top Seller."

505
00:31:29,220 --> 00:31:32,639
I remember this day.
You actually thanked me.

506
00:31:32,640 --> 00:31:34,224
Did you get a gift?

507
00:31:34,225 --> 00:31:35,351
Yeah.

508
00:31:37,312 --> 00:31:38,395
Feels so good.

509
00:31:38,396 --> 00:31:41,231
Ruyi, what's this?

510
00:31:41,232 --> 00:31:43,108
An egg vibrator.

511
00:31:43,109 --> 00:31:45,193
I'm single, so it's not weird to have one.

512
00:31:45,194 --> 00:31:46,321
Never mind.

513
00:31:46,821 --> 00:31:48,822
Do you like it?

514
00:31:48,823 --> 00:31:50,365
I do.

515
00:31:50,366 --> 00:31:51,659
What do you like?

516
00:31:53,244 --> 00:31:54,287
Nothing.

517
00:31:54,954 --> 00:31:57,998
I'll put the alcohol away for you for now.

518
00:31:57,999 --> 00:31:59,583
I can drink it later.

519
00:31:59,584 --> 00:32:02,754
I'll bring it back to you later.
You can't drink right now.

520
00:32:03,338 --> 00:32:04,547
We'll drink it later.

521
00:32:06,341 --> 00:32:08,133
Today's the 14th. Valentine's Day.

522
00:32:08,134 --> 00:32:09,551
No, I mean your checkup.

523
00:32:09,552 --> 00:32:12,472
I rented a car, and got you a return gift.

524
00:32:18,853 --> 00:32:20,980
Is the temperature okay?

525
00:32:21,981 --> 00:32:23,440
Feels great.

526
00:32:23,441 --> 00:32:24,359
Good.

527
00:32:24,984 --> 00:32:26,610
This rental wasn't cheap, huh?

528
00:32:26,611 --> 00:32:29,112
You know, this car has one
of the highest safety ratings.

529
00:32:29,113 --> 00:32:31,698
The back seat has extra protection, too.

530
00:32:31,699 --> 00:32:34,242
It scores really well in small-overlap,

531
00:32:34,243 --> 00:32:36,203
frontal-offset
and side-impact crash tests.

532
00:32:36,204 --> 00:32:39,331
After Taozi's born,
if you're thinking of buying a car,

533
00:32:39,332 --> 00:32:40,832
you could get this one.

534
00:32:40,833 --> 00:32:42,502
I'd have to afford it first.

535
00:32:43,002 --> 00:32:45,671
And keep track of what you spend.

536
00:32:45,672 --> 00:32:49,967
- I'll pay you back once I'm working again.
- It's okay. No need to pay me back.

537
00:32:49,968 --> 00:32:51,385
No. I'm paying you back.

538
00:32:51,386 --> 00:32:54,222
- If you won't let me, I'm getting out.
- Okay, okay.

539
00:32:55,723 --> 00:32:57,433
I also booked a postpartum center.

540
00:32:58,393 --> 00:33:00,143
Cancel the postpartum center.

541
00:33:00,144 --> 00:33:01,228
I'll just stay home

542
00:33:01,229 --> 00:33:02,938
- and order postpartum meals.
- No.

543
00:33:02,939 --> 00:33:05,566
They say postpartum recovery
is really important.

544
00:33:06,818 --> 00:33:09,069
All right. It's up to you.

545
00:33:09,070 --> 00:33:11,989
If you need any more help,
just let me know.

546
00:33:11,990 --> 00:33:13,157
No, thanks.

547
00:33:14,367 --> 00:33:16,202
Did your checkup go okay?

548
00:33:17,161 --> 00:33:18,538
I was really worried.

549
00:33:19,038 --> 00:33:21,123
Why are you worried?
You're not giving birth.

550
00:33:21,124 --> 00:33:23,667
I just worry about a lot of things.

551
00:33:23,668 --> 00:33:26,170
When Taozi's born, can I hold her?

552
00:33:30,174 --> 00:33:33,511
No offense. I just want to hold her.

553
00:33:37,098 --> 00:33:38,598
Why are you so good to us?

554
00:33:38,599 --> 00:33:40,268
You helped me once.

555
00:33:41,811 --> 00:33:44,396
I told you, I don't remember.
That was ages ago.

556
00:33:44,397 --> 00:33:47,607
- Why remember it for this long?
- It meant a lot to me.

557
00:33:47,608 --> 00:33:49,943
You were the only one who was nice to me.

558
00:33:49,944 --> 00:33:53,321
Once, I told you on your stream
that it was my birthday.

559
00:33:53,322 --> 00:33:56,159
You sang to me and even

560
00:33:56,951 --> 00:33:58,494
blew out a candle.

561
00:33:59,996 --> 00:34:03,416
No one had ever celebrated with me before.
You were the first.

562
00:34:06,044 --> 00:34:07,670
Over something that small?

563
00:34:08,254 --> 00:34:09,671
You're an idiot.

564
00:34:09,672 --> 00:34:11,841
Girls could easily take advantage of you.

565
00:34:12,341 --> 00:34:14,927
If I got duped,
I probably wouldn't even know it.

566
00:34:22,393 --> 00:34:25,937
Are you hungry?
There are snacks over there.

567
00:34:25,938 --> 00:34:27,190
No, thanks.

568
00:34:47,043 --> 00:34:48,086
Bye, Ruyi.

569
00:34:48,878 --> 00:34:51,213
I'll pick you up
for your checkup next week.

570
00:34:51,214 --> 00:34:52,423
Sure.

571
00:35:07,396 --> 00:35:08,606
Have a quick look.

572
00:35:10,942 --> 00:35:12,901
There's so much natural light.

573
00:35:12,902 --> 00:35:14,986
- See?
- Yeah. Huge windows.

574
00:35:14,987 --> 00:35:17,031
There's a park, too? Is that the park?

575
00:35:17,865 --> 00:35:19,492
Yeah, that's the park.

576
00:35:20,535 --> 00:35:21,535
When your kid gets older,

577
00:35:21,536 --> 00:35:24,247
they can run around and play there.
It's healthy.

578
00:35:24,914 --> 00:35:27,165
This is the best place I've seen
all month.

579
00:35:27,166 --> 00:35:29,835
I can't believe it's still available.

580
00:35:29,836 --> 00:35:32,130
Just waiting for the right tenant.

581
00:35:32,713 --> 00:35:34,422
It's 15,000 a month, utilities included.

582
00:35:34,423 --> 00:35:36,384
- That's so cheap!
- Yep.

583
00:35:36,968 --> 00:35:39,553
It's bigger and cheaper than my old place.

584
00:35:39,554 --> 00:35:40,929
Let's sign the lease.

585
00:35:40,930 --> 00:35:44,307
- Let me check out the bedroom.
- Sure.

586
00:35:44,308 --> 00:35:46,393
What's with this light?

587
00:35:46,394 --> 00:35:47,352
Damn it.

588
00:35:47,353 --> 00:35:50,231
If you rent it, I'll fix it right away.

589
00:35:50,982 --> 00:35:54,192
- Yeah, it's a small thing.
- No big deal, right?

590
00:35:54,193 --> 00:35:56,112
- Let me check that.
- No problem.

591
00:36:03,411 --> 00:36:04,370
Holy shit!

592
00:36:04,954 --> 00:36:06,080
There's a closet.

593
00:36:12,461 --> 00:36:13,796
Plenty of room for a bed.

594
00:36:33,858 --> 00:36:34,984
This is pretty nice.

595
00:36:35,860 --> 00:36:37,069
Why are you lying down?

596
00:36:38,112 --> 00:36:40,114
It's so comfy, I had to lie down.

597
00:36:41,365 --> 00:36:43,450
Yeah, the wood floors are nice.

598
00:36:43,451 --> 00:36:45,869
- Better than tile. Not as cold.
- Nice, right?

599
00:36:45,870 --> 00:36:46,912
Nice, right?

600
00:36:46,913 --> 00:36:48,872
Your kid can run around here.

601
00:36:48,873 --> 00:36:49,874
Let's sign.

602
00:36:50,374 --> 00:36:51,584
Sure, let's do it.

603
00:36:52,960 --> 00:36:54,502
Hey, the light's working now.

604
00:36:54,503 --> 00:36:57,756
- Lucky us.
- Want me to bring dinner tonight?

605
00:36:57,757 --> 00:36:58,966
Okay.

606
00:37:01,385 --> 00:37:02,594
Did you bring the lease?

607
00:37:02,595 --> 00:37:03,888
Yes.

608
00:37:08,226 --> 00:37:10,519
15,000. That's a good deal.

609
00:37:15,191 --> 00:37:17,276
Two months' deposit,
six months' rent upfront.

610
00:37:18,736 --> 00:37:19,737
Yeah.

611
00:37:20,780 --> 00:37:21,697
120,000?

612
00:37:22,490 --> 00:37:23,657
This area's really popular.

613
00:37:23,658 --> 00:37:24,866
All that upfront?

614
00:37:24,867 --> 00:37:26,077
Just a second.

615
00:37:27,119 --> 00:37:28,119
What? An earthquake?

616
00:37:28,120 --> 00:37:29,038
Hello?

617
00:37:29,538 --> 00:37:31,707
Ms. Chen Huilin,
you'd like to rent the place?

618
00:37:32,708 --> 00:37:33,541
Okay.

619
00:37:33,542 --> 00:37:34,459
I...

620
00:37:34,460 --> 00:37:35,877
- I'll take it.
- Deal.

621
00:37:35,878 --> 00:37:37,088
Sorry, it's taken.

622
00:37:38,673 --> 00:37:39,840
An earthquake?

623
00:37:40,508 --> 00:37:42,384
Earthquakes are common in Taiwan.

624
00:37:42,385 --> 00:37:44,428
- I'm Party B, right? Okay, got it.
- Right.

625
00:37:45,638 --> 00:37:47,598
- Why is it shaking so much?
- Transfer the money.

626
00:37:48,182 --> 00:37:49,767
- Yeah, yeah.
- That's...

627
00:37:50,559 --> 00:37:51,477
120,000.

628
00:37:52,436 --> 00:37:54,271
- Here.
- Can I scan your QR code?

629
00:37:54,272 --> 00:37:55,231
Okay.

630
00:37:55,731 --> 00:37:56,691
Sorry.

631
00:37:58,901 --> 00:37:59,860
Check if you got it.

632
00:38:00,444 --> 00:38:01,570
Okay, got it.

633
00:38:02,780 --> 00:38:03,906
Here's your copy.

634
00:38:05,157 --> 00:38:06,867
- Thank you.
- And this one's mine.

635
00:38:08,828 --> 00:38:09,829
Here are the keys.

636
00:38:14,500 --> 00:38:15,376
Thank you.

637
00:38:16,043 --> 00:38:17,545
- That's all, right?
- Okay.

638
00:38:30,308 --> 00:38:31,350
Oh, no.

639
00:38:34,228 --> 00:38:36,397
Why is Ruyi at the hospital?

640
00:38:38,733 --> 00:38:40,151
Is Taozi coming?

641
00:38:40,818 --> 00:38:43,321
I thought she wasn't due till next week.

642
00:38:46,365 --> 00:38:47,575
Where's my phone?

643
00:38:50,703 --> 00:38:51,954
Maybe she's early.

644
00:39:00,338 --> 00:39:01,629
Hey, Bro Xiao. What's up?

645
00:39:01,630 --> 00:39:03,548
She's at the hospital
waiting to give birth.

646
00:39:03,549 --> 00:39:05,343
Go home and get her hospital bag for me.

647
00:39:07,845 --> 00:39:09,054
Fuck!

648
00:39:09,055 --> 00:39:10,889
A-Hu picks now to cause trouble?

649
00:39:10,890 --> 00:39:12,557
I'll fucking kill him!

650
00:39:12,558 --> 00:39:13,476
Fuck!

651
00:39:21,734 --> 00:39:23,318
Watch out!

652
00:39:23,319 --> 00:39:25,070
I need to get to the hospital.

653
00:39:25,071 --> 00:39:26,489
Go another way.

654
00:39:26,989 --> 00:39:28,282
This way's faster.

655
00:39:44,924 --> 00:39:46,008
You okay?

656
00:39:46,509 --> 00:39:47,634
Are you okay?

657
00:39:47,635 --> 00:39:48,802
Call an ambulance.

658
00:39:48,803 --> 00:39:50,388
Die!

659
00:39:54,558 --> 00:39:56,560
Good thing I was wearing a helmet.

660
00:39:58,729 --> 00:40:01,273
Put it on! Put it on! Hurry!

661
00:40:06,946 --> 00:40:08,071
Baby's head is down.

662
00:40:08,072 --> 00:40:10,199
- We're ready to deliver.
- Now?

663
00:40:11,534 --> 00:40:12,534
Chang Ruyi?

664
00:40:12,535 --> 00:40:14,786
What are you doing here?
Aren't you due in two weeks?

665
00:40:14,787 --> 00:40:16,955
- One more time.
- Why are you coming so early?

666
00:40:16,956 --> 00:40:18,581
Come on, Mom. Push.

667
00:40:18,582 --> 00:40:21,126
- Take a deep breath.
- Push one more time.

668
00:40:21,127 --> 00:40:22,210
Push down. Come on!

669
00:40:22,211 --> 00:40:24,629
Li Zhuzhu, you can do this!

670
00:40:24,630 --> 00:40:26,132
Almost here!

671
00:40:27,216 --> 00:40:28,049
I'll go help her.

672
00:40:28,050 --> 00:40:29,385
Be right back. Wait for me.

673
00:40:30,386 --> 00:40:31,636
Make some noise. One more time.

674
00:40:31,637 --> 00:40:32,971
You can do this.

675
00:40:32,972 --> 00:40:35,181
Li Zhuzhu, you can do it!

676
00:40:35,182 --> 00:40:36,266
You're Chang Ruyi.

677
00:40:36,267 --> 00:40:38,352
Just like your name, it'll work out.

678
00:40:42,064 --> 00:40:43,064
Sir, sir.

679
00:40:43,065 --> 00:40:44,357
There's nothing to see here.

680
00:40:44,358 --> 00:40:45,484
Sir?

681
00:40:49,321 --> 00:40:50,447
You okay?

682
00:40:50,448 --> 00:40:52,073
Sir, are you hurt anywhere?

683
00:40:52,074 --> 00:40:54,075
- Sir?
- Let's sit you up.

684
00:40:54,076 --> 00:40:55,618
- Easy. Careful.
- Careful. Come on.

685
00:40:55,619 --> 00:40:57,454
- Thanks.
- Let's get you on the stretcher.

686
00:40:57,455 --> 00:40:58,371
Let's get you up.

687
00:40:58,372 --> 00:40:59,289
Are you okay?

688
00:40:59,290 --> 00:41:00,249
Come on.

689
00:41:01,167 --> 00:41:02,917
I told you it was dangerous.

690
00:41:02,918 --> 00:41:04,711
I was in a hurry.

691
00:41:04,712 --> 00:41:06,671
Easy. Lie down.

692
00:41:06,672 --> 00:41:07,964
Lift your legs up.

693
00:41:07,965 --> 00:41:10,468
- Okay, careful.
- Just relax.

694
00:41:11,260 --> 00:41:12,177
Patient, lie back.

695
00:41:12,178 --> 00:41:13,429
- Hospital first.
- Okay.

696
00:41:14,638 --> 00:41:16,307
Okay, one, two, three.

697
00:41:18,225 --> 00:41:19,268
Okay, come on.

698
00:41:22,271 --> 00:41:23,439
Take care.

699
00:41:30,863 --> 00:41:32,114
Am I seeing things?

700
00:41:41,749 --> 00:41:44,501
I can't reincarnate yet.
Ruyi's still at the hospital.

701
00:41:44,502 --> 00:41:46,878
- Why are you in my house?
- No, ma'am. This is my house.

702
00:41:46,879 --> 00:41:48,671
- I just rented this place.
- Who's he?

703
00:41:48,672 --> 00:41:51,007
- You can see me?
- I can see all of you.

704
00:41:51,008 --> 00:41:52,467
What do you mean, all of me?

705
00:41:52,468 --> 00:41:54,470
- Walk through walls, then haunt dreams.
- Again.

706
00:41:58,849 --> 00:42:00,683
Guard the room in shifts. Protect her.

707
00:42:00,684 --> 00:42:02,603
I'm going to talk to A-Hu.

708
00:42:04,605 --> 00:42:05,813
Possess.

709
00:42:05,814 --> 00:42:06,856
I'm moving back in.

710
00:42:06,857 --> 00:42:07,858
Live with me?

711
00:42:10,486 --> 00:42:11,695
He's a ghost.
